+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : intersectionRing aPP2                           |
|                                                     |
|              QQ[][t ..t ]                           |
|                    0   2                            |
|o4 = ------------------------------                  |
|     (t t t , - t  + t , - t  + t )                  |
|       0 1 2     0    1     0    2                   |
|                                                     |
|o4 : QuotientRing                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : intersectionRing tPP2                           |
|                                                     |
|              QQ[][t ..t ]                           |
|                    0   2                            |
|o5 = ------------------------------                  |
|     (t t t , - t  + t , - t  + t )                  |
|       0 1 2     0    1     0    2                   |
|                                                     |
|o5 : QuotientRing                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : intersectionRing abstractVariety (tPP2, base()) |
|                                                     |
|              QQ[][t ..t ]                           |
|                    0   2                            |
|o6 = ------------------------------                  |
|     (t t t , - t  + t , - t  + t )                  |
|       0 1 2     0    1     0    2                   |
|                                                     |
|o6 : QuotientRing                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : intersectionRing abstractVariety (tPP2, base(a))|
|                                                     |
|              QQ[a][t ..t ]                          |
|                     0   2                           |
|o7 = ------------------------------                  |
|     (t t t , - t  + t , - t  + t )                  |
|       0 1 2     0    1     0    2                   |
|                                                     |
|o7 : QuotientRing                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
