|                                                     |
|o8 = PP2                                             |
|                                                     |
|o8 : NormalToricVariety                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : intersectionRing PP2                            |
|                                                     |
|              QQ[][t ..t ]                           |
|                    0   2                            |
|o9 = ------------------------------                  |
|     (t t t , - t  + t , - t  + t )                  |
|       0 1 2     0    1     0    2                   |
|                                                     |
