    toric divisors and their related groups
  * *note fromCDivToWDiv(NormalToricVariety):
    fromCDivToWDiv_lpNormalToricVariety_rp, -- get the map from Cartier
    divisors to Weil divisors
  * *note fromCDivToPic(NormalToricVariety):
    fromCDivToPic_lpNormalToricVariety_rp, -- get the map from Cartier divisors
    to the Picard group
  * *note isCartier(ToricDivisor): isCartier_lpToricDivisor_rp, -- whether a
    torus-invariant Weil divisor is Cartier
  * *note cartierDivisorGroup(ToricMap): cartierDivisorGroup_lpToricMap_rp, --
    make the induced map between groups of Cartier divisors.

