degree(ToricDivisor) -- make the degree of the associated rank-one reflexive sheaf
**********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note degree: (Macaulay2Doc)degree,
  * Usage: 
        degree D
  * Inputs:
      * D, a *note toric divisor: ToricDivisor,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of *note integers: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,
        corresponding to the degree of the rank-one reflexive sheaf

Description
===========

This function returns the *note List: (Macaulay2Doc)List, representing an
element of the Picard group corresponding to the associated rank-one reflexive
sheaf.

Here are two simple examples.

+------------------------------------------+
|i1 : PP2 = toricProjectiveSpace 2;        |
+------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D1 = PP2_0                           |
|                                          |
|o2 = PP2                                  |
|        0                                 |
|                                          |
|o2 : ToricDivisor on PP2                  |
+------------------------------------------+
|i3 : degree D1                            |
|                                          |
|o3 = {1}                                  |
|                                          |
|o3 : List                                 |
+------------------------------------------+
|i4 : OO D1                                |
|                                          |
|          1                               |
|o4 = OO    (1)                            |
|       PP2                                |
|                                          |
|o4 : coherent sheaf on PP2, free of rank 1|
+------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D2 = 3*PP2_1                         |
|                                          |
|o5 = 3*PP2                                |
|          1                               |
|                                          |
|o5 : ToricDivisor on PP2                  |
+------------------------------------------+
|i6 : degree D2                            |
|                                          |
|o6 = {3}                                  |
|                                          |
|o6 : List                                 |
+------------------------------------------+
|i7 : OO D2                                |
|                                          |
|          1                               |
|o7 = OO    (3)                            |
|       PP2                                |
|                                          |
|o7 : coherent sheaf on PP2, free of rank 1|
+------------------------------------------+
+-------------------------------------------+
|i8 : FF2 = hirzebruchSurface 2;            |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i9 : D3 = -1*FF2_2 + 3*FF2_3               |
|                                           |
|o9 = - FF2  + 3*FF2                        |
|          2        3                       |
|                                           |
|o9 : ToricDivisor on FF2                   |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i10 : degree D3                            |
|                                           |
|o10 = {-1, 3}                              |
|                                           |
|o10 : List                                 |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i11 : OO D3                                |
|                                           |
|           1                               |
|o11 = OO     (-1, 3)                       |
|        FF2                                |
|                                           |
|o11 : coherent sheaf on FF2, free of rank 1|
+-------------------------------------------+

