    canonical inclusion into a product
  * *note NormalToricVariety ** NormalToricVariety: NormalToricVariety _st_st
    NormalToricVariety, -- make the Cartesian product of two normal toric
    varieties
  * *note cartesianProduct(Sequence): cartesianProduct_lpSequence_rp, -- make
    the Cartesian product of normal toric varieties
  * *note components: (Macaulay2Doc)components, -- list the components of a
    direct sum
  * *note toricBlowup: toricBlowup_lpList_cmNormalToricVariety_cmList_rp, --
    makes the toricBlowup of a normal toric variety along a torus orbit closure
  * *note Module ^ Array: (Macaulay2Doc)Module ^ Array, -- projection onto
    summand

