    toric divisors and their related groups
  * *note classGroup(NormalToricVariety): classGroup_lpNormalToricVariety_rp,
    -- make the class group
  * *note cartierDivisorGroup(NormalToricVariety):
    cartierDivisorGroup_lpNormalToricVariety_rp, -- compute the group of
    torus-invariant Cartier divisors
  * *note fromCDivToPic(NormalToricVariety):
    fromCDivToPic_lpNormalToricVariety_rp, -- get the map from Cartier divisors
    to the Picard group
  * *note fromPicToCl(NormalToricVariety): fromPicToCl_lpNormalToricVariety_rp,
    -- get the map from Picard group to class group
  * *note picardGroup(ToricMap): picardGroup_lpToricMap_rp, -- make the induced
    map between Picard groups

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note picardGroup(NormalToricVariety): picardGroup_lpNormalToricVariety_rp,
    -- make the Picard group
