    toric divisors and their related groups
  * *note toricDivisor: toricDivisor_lpList_cmNormalToricVariety_rp, -- make a
    torus-invariant Weil divisor
  * *note OO ToricDivisor: OO ToricDivisor, -- make the associated rank-one
    reflexive sheaf
  * *note HH^ZZ(NormalToricVariety,CoherentSheaf):
    HH^ZZ_lpNormalToricVariety_cmCoherentSheaf_rp, -- compute the cohomology of
    a coherent sheaf

