    diagonalToricMap, -- make a diagonal map into a Cartesian product
  * "diagonalToricMap(NormalToricVariety,ZZ)" -- see *note diagonalToricMap:
    diagonalToricMap, -- make a diagonal map into a Cartesian product
  * "diagonalToricMap(NormalToricVariety,ZZ,Array)" -- see *note
    diagonalToricMap: diagonalToricMap, -- make a diagonal map into a Cartesian
    product
